---
import { snippets } from '../data/experiment-snippets';
const { kind }=Astro.props;
---
<section class="experiment" data-experiment={kind}>
<div class="bench">
<div class="stage">
{kind==='magnets' && <><svg viewBox="0 0 640 360" aria-label="磁石と小物の机" role="group"><path d="M20 334h600" stroke="#aebbc1" stroke-dasharray="3 6"/><g data-particles></g><g data-magnet role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="磁石。矢印キーで移動" transform="translate(320 160)"><circle r="42" fill="#f7ded8" stroke="#354550" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M-17-15v24a17 17 0 0 0 34 0v-24" fill="none" stroke="#b8665f" stroke-width="12"/><path d="M-17-15v10m34-10v10" stroke="#f8f4e9" stroke-width="12"/></g></svg><p>磁石をドラッグ。キーボードなら矢印キーで動かせます。</p></>}
{kind==='chain' && <><svg viewBox="0 0 640 360" aria-label="玉からドミノ、引き出しへつながる装置" role="img"><path d="m32 130 230 85h190" fill="none" stroke="#354550" stroke-width="5"/><circle data-ball style="transform-origin:50px 108px" cx="50" cy="108" r="16" fill="#e2bb5c" stroke="#354550" stroke-width="2"/>{[0,1,2,3,4].map(i=><rect data-domino x={280+i*34} y="157" width="12" height="56" rx="3" fill={i%2?'#d8e7dd':'#dce7f5'} stroke="#354550" stroke-width="2" style={`transform-origin:${286+i*34}px 213px`}/>)}<rect x="460" y="150" width="145" height="112" rx="8" fill="#e9e4d8" stroke="#354550" stroke-width="3"/><g data-chain-drawer><rect x="470" y="165" width="125" height="79" rx="4" fill="#fff0bc" stroke="#354550" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M510 204h44" stroke="#354550" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round"/></g><g data-hello opacity="0"><rect x="439" y="61" width="174" height="54" rx="13" fill="white" stroke="#354550" stroke-width="2"/><text x="526" y="96" text-anchor="middle" font-size="23" fill="#354550">こんにちは！</text></g><text x="48" y="310" font-size="14" fill="#66777f">ひと押しが、次のひと押しになる。</text></svg><p>スイッチを押すと、順番に動き始めます。</p></>}
{kind==='buttons' && <><div class="button-shelf">{[['rubber','ゴム','#dceadf'],['jelly','ゼリー','#e8dff5'],['key','キー','#fff0bc']].map(([type,label,color])=><div><button class:list={['sample-button',type]} data-material={type} style={`--cap:${color}`} type="button">{label}<span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></button><small>{type==='rubber'?'むにっ':type==='jelly'?'ぷるん': 'かちっ'}</small></div>)}</div><p>長押しして、離してみてください。Spaceキーでも押せます。</p></>}
{kind==='cables' && <><svg viewBox="0 0 640 360" role="img" aria-label="パソコン、モニター、充電器の配線図"><rect x="35" y="67" width="170" height="110" rx="8" fill="#e3eee6" stroke="#354550" stroke-width="3"/><text x="120" y="130" text-anchor="middle" fill="#354550">パソコン</text><path d="M20 190h200l-15-13H35z" fill="#dce7f5" stroke="#354550" stroke-width="2"/><rect x="425" y="35" width="180" height="120" rx="8" fill="#e7e4dd" stroke="#354550" stroke-width="3"/><rect data-monitor x="437" y="47" width="156" height="90" rx="3" fill="#44515a"/><path d="M515 157v20m-35 0h70" stroke="#354550" stroke-width="4"/><text data-screen-text x="515" y="100" fill="white" text-anchor="middle">OFF</text><rect x="455" y="240" width="130" height="70" rx="13" fill="#fff0bc" stroke="#354550" stroke-width="2"/><text x="520" y="283" fill="#354550" text-anchor="middle">充電器</text><g data-wires></g><g data-sockets></g><circle data-power cx="193" cy="78" r="6" fill="#929a9b"/></svg><div class="port-grid">{[['pc-video','PC：映像出力'],['monitor','モニター：映像入力'],['pc-power','PC：電源入力'],['charger','充電器：電源出力']].map(([id,label])=><button type="button" data-port={id} aria-pressed="false">{label}</button>)}</div><p>丸い端子から接続先へドラッグ。下のボタンを2つ選んでもつなげます。</p></>}
{kind==='study' && <><svg class="study-scene" viewBox="0 0 640 360" role="img" aria-label="窓と机とランプのある書斎"><rect data-wall width="640" height="360" fill="#f5f1e7"/><rect data-sky x="365" y="30" width="210" height="145" rx="6" fill="#b9dbea" stroke="#354550" stroke-width="3"/><circle data-sun cx="526" cy="69" r="22" fill="#ffe5a0"/><g data-blinds>{[0,1,2,3,4,5].map(i=><rect x="367" y={32+i*23} width="206" height="18" fill="#ded7c5" stroke="#a89f8a"/>)}</g><path d="M470 30v145M365 103h210" stroke="#354550" stroke-width="3"/><path data-light-beam d="M160 110 60 282h290z" fill="#ffe59a" opacity=".26"/><rect data-desk x="30" y="280" width="580" height="20" rx="5" fill="#c69c72"/><path d="M70 300v55m500-55v55" stroke="#354550" stroke-width="9"/><ellipse data-study-shadow cx="350" cy="276" rx="70" ry="8" fill="#354550" opacity=".2"/><rect x="270" y="185" width="145" height="86" rx="6" fill="#d9e4e6" stroke="#354550" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="280" y="195" width="125" height="64" rx="3" fill="#405863"/><path d="m264 272-9 8h174l-8-8" fill="#cbd4df" stroke="#354550" stroke-width="2"/><g data-lamp><path fill="none" d="M100 277h90m-44 0V166l32-47" stroke="#354550" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="m155 93 44 17-10 36-61-24z" fill="#f3d682" stroke="#354550" stroke-width="3"/></g><path d="M465 261h36v19h-36z" fill="#eee0d3" stroke="#354550" stroke-width="2"/></svg><p>明かりと影を動かして、好きな時間の書斎をつくろう。</p></>}
{kind==='letters' && <><svg viewBox="0 0 640 360" role="group" aria-label="文字の積み木"><path d="M10 345h620" stroke="#354550" stroke-width="3"/><g data-blocks></g></svg><p>文字をドラッグ、またはTabで選び矢印キーで移動。最大16文字。</p></>}
</div>
<div class="controls"><h2>遊び方のレシピ</h2>
{kind==='magnets' && <><label>磁力 <input type="range" data-strength min="10" max="100" value="55" /></label><fieldset><legend>磁石の働き</legend><label><input name="polarity" type="radio" value="1" checked /> 引きよせる</label><label><input name="polarity" type="radio" value="-1" /> 反発する</label></fieldset><button data-reset type="button">小物を並べ直す ↺</button></>}
{kind==='chain' && <><label>再生の速さ <input data-speed type="range" min="50" max="180" value="100" /></label><button data-run type="button">からくりを動かす →</button><button data-reset type="button">最初に戻す ↺</button></>}
{kind==='buttons' && <><label>沈む深さ <input data-depth type="range" min="3" max="20" value="10" /></label><label>戻る速さ <input data-duration type="range" min="200" max="1000" value="550" /></label><p class="small">同じ設定でも素材ごとに変形が違います。音は鳴りません。</p></>}
{kind==='cables' && <><p>映像の出力 → 入力<br />電源の出力 → 入力</p><button data-reset type="button">ケーブルを外す ↺</button><p class="small">これは接続の考え方を遊ぶ模型です。実製品の端子・互換性を再現したものではありません。</p></>}
{kind==='study' && <><button data-night type="button" aria-pressed="false">夜にする</button><button data-lamp-toggle type="button" aria-pressed="true">ランプを消す</button><label>ランプの位置 <input data-light-x type="range" min="-30" max="75" value="0" /></label><label>ブラインドを開ける <input data-blinds-open type="range" min="0" max="100" value="60" /></label><label>机の色 <select data-desk-color><option value="#c69c72">オーク</option><option value="#8c6955">ウォルナット</option><option value="#dce7df">ミント</option></select></label></>}
{kind==='letters' && <><label for="toy-words">落とす言葉</label><input id="toy-words" type="text" value="りゅうのらぼ" maxlength="32" /><button data-drop type="button">文字を落とす ↓</button><button data-shake type="button">箱をゆらす ↔</button><button data-reset type="button">空にする ↺</button></>}
<p data-status role="status" class="feedback">準備できました。</p><p class="small">端末の「視差効果を減らす」設定では、動きを抑えて表示します。</p></div>
</div>
<details class="source-note"><summary>この仕掛けのコードを見る</summary><pre><code data-code>{snippets[kind]}</code></pre><p>仕組みを示す抜粋です。描画、入力操作、停止処理を含む全体はこちら。</p><a href="https://github.com/R-Koda/ryu-koda.com/blob/main/src/scripts/experiments.ts" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">実装全体をGitHubで見る ↗</a></details>
</section>
<script>import '../scripts/experiments';</script>
<style>
.bench{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.8fr) minmax(240px,1fr);gap:24px}.stage{border:2px solid #354550;border-radius:12px 18px 10px 9px;box-shadow:5px 6px 0 #e7edf3;min-width:0;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(#aab8c333 1px,transparent 1px) 0 0/18px 18px}.stage svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;touch-action:pan-y}.stage>p{padding:16px 22px;font-size:12px;color:#52626b;line-height:1.8;border-top:1px dashed #d6dfe2}.controls{padding:24px;background:#fffae9;border:1px solid #ded1af;border-radius:7px 13px 8px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}.controls h2{font-size:18px;font-weight:700}.controls label{font-size:13px;display:block}.controls input[type=range]{display:block;width:100%;height:32px;accent-color:#526c86}.controls fieldset{border:0;padding:0;font-size:13px}.controls button,.port-grid button{padding:11px 14px;min-height:44px;border:1.5px solid #354550;background:white;border-radius:5px;box-shadow:2px 3px 0 #354550;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px}.controls button:hover,.port-grid button:hover{background:#e4eee8}.controls button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:default}.controls input[type=text],select{width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #a0aaac;border-radius:4px;background:white;font:inherit}.small{font-size:11px;color:#636960;line-height:1.8}.feedback{font-size:13px;color:#355d4b;min-height:2em}.source-note{margin-top:32px;padding:20px;background:#f3f6f8;border:1px solid #d7dfe5;border-radius:8px;font-size:13px}.source-note summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}.source-note pre{overflow:auto;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;padding:16px 0}.source-note p{margin-bottom:12px}.button-shelf{display:flex;justify-content:space-evenly;align-items:center;gap:16px;min-height:330px;padding:35px 20px}.button-shelf>div{text-align:center;flex:1}.button-shelf small{display:block;margin-top:28px;font-size:12px;color:#6b7174}.sample-button{width:100%;max-width:145px;min-height:100px;border:2px solid #354550;background:var(--cap);box-shadow:0 9px 0 #354550;cursor:pointer;touch-action:manipulation;font:inherit;transform-origin:center bottom}.sample-button span{display:block;font-size:24px}.rubber{border-radius:24px}.jelly{border-radius:45% 45% 38% 38%;box-shadow:0 9px 0 #9283a5,inset 5px 6px 0 #ffffff66}.key{border-radius:9px;box-shadow:0 9px 0 #b19c5f,inset 0 0 0 7px #ffffff55}.port-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;padding:15px}.port-grid button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#fff0bc;outline:2px solid #6587a1}.study-scene{border-radius:9px}.stage :global([data-socket]){cursor:crosshair;touch-action:none}.stage :global([data-magnet]),.stage :global([data-block]){cursor:grab;touch-action:none}.stage :global([data-magnet]:focus-visible),.stage :global([data-block]:focus-visible){outline:none;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 4px #2458a6)}@media(max-width:760px){.bench{grid-template-columns:1fr}.button-shelf{min-height:250px;padding:25px 12px;gap:12px}.sample-button{font-size:13px;min-height:80px}.controls{padding:20px}}
</style>
